  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ONTARIO QUEBEC &amp; ATLANTIC: PROTECTING WE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds for this award will permanently secure 2,135 acres through 2,055 acres of fee simple acquisition, and 80 acres of conservation easements. Funds under this award will also be used to enhance 180 acres, to manage 93,050 acres of previously secured habitat, and to steward 870 acres. The purpose of this award if therefore to secure, enhance, manage, and steward habitat for the benefit of migratory birds and other wildlife in the Canadian provinces of Ontario, Qubec, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Prince Edward Island, Newfoundland and Labrador.</narrative>
  </description>
